<title>GERMANY: BASF to increase bonus for 1996.</title>
<headline>BASF to increase bonus for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LUDWIGSHAFEN, Germany 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals group BASF AG said on Tuesday it would increase its annual bonus payment for employees to 175 percent of average monthly earnings this year from 170 percent last year.</p>
<p>That amounts to a total payout of about 470 million marks this year, up from 458 million last year, BASF said in a statement. The bonus will be paid out on November 29.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
